  "notes": "First-party Four Seasons pages (fourseasons.com/sanfrancisco/ and press.fourseasons.com/sanfrancisco/hotel-facts/) match the SoT claim ('12 floors within a 42-storey tower'), with the e-brochure clarifying that the hotel lobby is on floor 5 and rooms are on floors 6–17 (12 physical floors, skipping floor 13). However, skyscraper databases (CTBUH Skyscraper Center, Structurae, SkyscraperPage, SKYDB), hospitality trade press (Hotel Business, HospitalityNet), engineering records (Seismic Design Consultants: 37 stories), and residential real estate portals for the tower's condominium address at 765 Market St (Homes.com, Compass, Houzeo, RubyHome, The Real Deal, Late Checkout, San Francisco Condo Market) report 40 physical stories (or 37–39 stories)."
